{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790771700, "covers_from": "2026-09-30T12:35:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-30T12:36:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790771760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-30T12:35:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 54193, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "真的超受不了吸到沿路邊走邊抽菸的人的二手菸，拜託市長想想辦法，每天都會聞到好多次，真的頭很暈！！！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.54,193", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T12:35:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 54194, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "我住大同區延平北路二段，行人走的騎樓停滿摩托車，有兩個小學在旁邊，這區老人輪椅多，每次雙向經過很困難", "display_name": "大同代表 Mi(廖苡蕎，廖杰文)🐩🇹🇼🇺🇸", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T12:35:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24131, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "有沒有可能用無人計程車專跑個人住家到捷運站點？回程也是。這樣長程通勤還是使用捷運，但又有短程便利性？", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.24,131", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T12:35:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8587, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "教育", "content": "想請教答B市長，我想就讀師大附中國中部，\n有什麼捷徑可以達成小民我這大大的願望？", "display_name": "大安代表 No.8,587", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 54194, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 Mi(廖苡蕎，廖杰文)🐩🇹🇼🇺🇸", "district": "datong", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 24131, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.24,131", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 8587, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.8,587", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 54195, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代